{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06809","headline":"万岁楼 · 王昌龄","name":"万岁楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上巍巍万岁楼，不知经历几千秋。\n年年喜见山长在，日日悲看水独流。\n猿狖何曾离暮岭，鸬鹚空自泛寒洲。\n谁堪登望云烟里，向晚茫茫发旅愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}